## Original Content
Une semaine après sa première sortie extravéhiculaire historique, Sophie Adenot retourne hors de la Station spatiale internationale. La Française, accompagnée de l’astronaute américain Anil Menon, doit achever le remplacement d’une antenne de communication essentielle entre l’ISS et le centre de contrôle de Houston. Explications de notre journaliste Sylvain Rousseau.

## Summary
French astronaut Sophie Adenot is conducting her second spacewalk outside the International Space Station with American astronaut Anil Menon. They are replacing a communication antenna essential for ISS-Houston communication. This mission follows her historic first spacewalk a week earlier.

## Key Points
- Sophie Adenot performs her second spacewalk, building on her historic first one a week prior.
- She is accompanied by American astronaut Anil Menon for the task.
- The primary objective is to replace a communication antenna critical for ISS-Houston communication.
- Journalist Sylvain Rousseau provides context and explanation for the mission.


